                      "value": "<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/search/?q=Ranunculaceae&amp;w=91314344@N00&amp;m=tags\">Ranunculaceae</a> (buttercup family) » <i><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.flickr.com/search/?q=Anemoneobtusiloba&amp;w=91314344@N00&amp;m=tags\">Anemone obtusiloba</a></i>\n</p><p><b>uh-NEM-oh-nee</b> -- wind\n<b>ob-too-sih-LOH-ba</b> -- having blunt lobes\n</p><p><b>commonly known as</b>: Himalayan thimbleweed • <b>Lepcha</b>: jarlyoung reep • <b>Nepali</b>: रतनजोत ratanjot • <b>Tamang</b>: rikabe\n</p><p><b>Native to</b>: Himalayas (2000 - 3400 m)\n</p>\n<b>References</b>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.flowersofindia.net/catalog/slides/Himalayan%20Thimbleweed.html\">Flowers of India</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://davesgarden.com/guides/pf/go/48864/\">Dave's Garden</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.impgc.com/plantinfo_A.php?id=528\">IMPGC</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ibiblio.org/pfaf/cgi-bin/arr_html?Anemone+obtusiloba\">Plants For A Future</a> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.theplantlist.org/tpl/record/kew-2638514\">The Plants List</a>",
